WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.940
Shipments board: every shipment by stage, from booking to delivery.

2
00:00:06.489 --> 00:00:11.000
Columns are stages; open a shipment to see its "Timeline".

3
00:00:11.552 --> 00:00:16.380
Use the "Exceptions" filter to see only problem or late shipments.

4
00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:21.520
If shop orders or DM requests aren't here yet, click "Sync".

5
00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:29.530
Don't forget "Send the status to the customer" at each status change; an uninformed customer messages more.
